author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Describe the bug\n\ntest_reflection fails when running with mariadb connector or against MariaDB server > 10.6.0:\r\n\r\n- Default character set for mariadb dialect is utf8mb4 - it cannot be changed.\r\n- Since MariaDB 10.6.1 utf8 character set is mapped to utf8mb3 (and will be mapped to utf8mb4 in 10.7). See https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-8334.\r\n\r\nProposed solution: when testing against a MariaDB server or with mariadb dialect, use character set utf8mb4 instead of utf8.\n\n### To Reproduce\n\n```python\npytest  --dburi=mariadb+mariadbconnector://foobar:foobar@127.0.0.1:3306/test test/dialect/mysql/test_reflection.py\n```\n\n\n### Error\n\n```\r\n_______________________ ReflectionTest_mariadb+mariadbconnector_10_6_4.test_reflection_with_table_options ________________________\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"/home/georg/work/python/sqlalchemy/test/dialect/mysql/test_reflection.py\", line 341, in test_reflection_with_table_options\r\n    assert def_table.kwargs[\"mariadb_default_charset\"] == \"utf8\"\r\nAssertionError: assert 'utf8mb4' == 'utf8'\r\n  - utf8\r\n  + utf8mb4\r\n```\n\n### Versions\n\n- OS: Linux\r\n- Python: 3.9.6\r\n- SQLAlchemy: master branch, latest version\r\n- Database: MariaDB 10.6\r\n- DBAPI (eg: psycopg, cx_oracle, mysqlclient): mariadbconnector\r\n\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"sqlalchemy-bot","id":36047385,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2MDQ3Mzg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36047385?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy-bot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sqlalchemy-bot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users